# ── Autofill (merged IDP Extractor) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Version snapshots are full folder copies (~78 MB each) and redundant with git,
# which is already version control. The Update button still pulls the latest from
# the shared server path in version_source.txt, and Training re-publishes locally.
# The trained knowledge base itself (learned_logic.json / knowledge_base.json) IS
# tracked, so a fresh clone ships the learned logic.
archive/
Version Control/
Autofill/build_staging/
Autofill/__pycache__/
Autofill/ErrorReports/
*.tmp
